* Chunk naming: retain a route instruction while checking the road.
Goal: Follow a remembered route instruction
. Goal: Acquire instruction
.. Hear Turn at <Oak Street>
. Goal: Monitor road
.. Look at <traffic ahead>
.. Verify lane is clear
. Goal: Find turn
.. Recall <Oak Street>
.. Search for <Oak Street>
. Goal: Turn onto street
.. Hands to steering wheel
.. Turn steering wheel
.. Verify vehicle is on <Oak Street>
